1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Lena always dreamed of opening her own bakery.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
She spent years perfecting her recipes, saving money,

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:11,000
and finally, she opened a cozy little shop in the heart of her town.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,000
But before starting, Lena had done something unusual.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,000
She read stories about bakery failures.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
She learned about one shop that went under because they didn't track expenses,

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
and another that lost customers by ignoring negative reviews.

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Lena took notes, so when her oven broke down a month after opening,

9
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,000
she didn't panic.

10
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,000
She had budgeted for emergencies.

11
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,000
When a customer complained that her croissants were too salty,

12
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,000
she didn't get defensive.

13
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,000
She tested the recipe again and made adjustments.

14
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Because Lena had learned it from others' mistakes,

15
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,000
she avoided making the same ones herself.

16
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Her bakery didn't just survive.

17
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,000
It thrived.

18
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
No matter how intelligent or capable you are,

19
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:57,000
you will inevitably face mistakes along your journey.

20
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,000
That's why it's so important to learn from the experiences

21
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,000
and the errors of others.

22
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,000
It's not just about avoiding failure,

23
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,000
but about preparing yourself for when challenges arise.

24
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,000
By understanding the hardships others have faced,

25
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,000
you'll be better equipped to handle your own when they come.

26
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:19,000
It's about building the wisdom and resilience to face setbacks with confidence and clarity.

